        "subject": "=⚠️ Invoice Requires Human Review - {{ $json.invoice_number }}",
        "message": "=<h2>⚠️ Invoice Requires Human Review</h2>\n\n<p>An invoice failed automated validation and requires manual review.</p>\n\n<h3>Invoice Details</h3>\n\n<p>\n<strong>Invoice Number:</strong> {{ $json.invoice_number }}<br>\n<strong>Vendor:</strong> {{ $json.vendor_name }}<br>\n<strong>Invoice Date:</strong> {{ $json.invoice_date }}<br>\n<strong>Due Date:</strong> {{ $json.due_date }}<br>\n<strong>Purchase Order:</strong> {{ $json.purchase_order }}<br>\n<strong>Currency:</strong> {{ $json.currency }}\n</p>\n\n<h3>Financial Details</h3>\n\n<p>\n<strong>Subtotal:</strong> {{ $json.subtotal }}<br>\n<strong>Tax:</strong> {{ $json.tax }}<br>\n<strong>Invoice Total:</strong> {{ $json.total }}\n</p>\n\n<h3>⚠️ Validation Error</h3>\n\n<p>\n{{ $json.validation_errors }}\n</p>\n\n<hr>\n\n<p>\n<strong>Human Review Required:</strong><br>\nThis invoice was not automatically approved because it failed validation.\nReview the original document and extracted data before taking further action.\n</p>",
